# Source data is stored and checked out byte for byte, so checksums in
# Attachments/SOURCE.md hold on every platform (no line-ending conversion).
Attachments/*.csv -text

# The interim core is identified by the SHA-256 of its bytes (Decision Records quote it),
# so it is checked out byte for byte too.
Code/core.py -text
# The same for each analysis's own interim core (e.g. Code/sepsis/core.py).
Code/*/core.py -text
